{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_93","type":"agent_message","text":"1. **Additional refactoring strategy used**\n- Moved one cohesive attribute-management cluster out of `org.jsoup.nodes` into a focused subpackage:\n  - `Attribute`\n  - `Attributes`\n- Destination package: `org.jsoup.nodes.attributes`\n- Strategy: relocate the cluster, then apply only required package/import/visibility compatibility updates so existing callers compile without introducing new abstractions.\n\n2. **Selected cluster / cohesion / moved classes**\n- **Selected cluster:** attribute model + attribute container.\n- **Why cohesive:** `Attribute` and `Attributes` are tightly coupled (parent linkage, mutation propagation, serialization/range handling), and are conceptually a self-contained subdomain within nodes.\n- **Classes moved:**\n  - `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/Attribute.java` -> `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/attributes/Attribute.java`\n  - `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/Attributes.java` -> `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/attributes/Attributes.java`\n\n3. **Files changed**\n- Core moved files:\n  - `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/attributes/Attribute.java`\n  - `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/attributes/Attributes.java`\n- Compatibility touchpoints (imports/references/minimal access alignment), including:\n  - `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/Element.java`\n  - `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/Node.java`\n  - `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/LeafNode.java`\n  - `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/ElementIdentityOps.java`\n  - `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/NodeInternals.java`\n  - `src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/Range.java`\n  - parser/safety/select/helper classes that referenced `org.jsoup.nodes.Attribute(s)` (updated to `org.jsoup.nodes.attributes.*`)\n  - related tests updated for new imports/references.\n\n4. **Expected impact on the smell**\n- This reduces `org.jsoup.nodes` package concentration by extracting a strongly-related pair into a meaningful subpackage (`attributes`), which should lower package-level God Component pressure without scattering responsibilities.\n\n5. **Validation command executed**\n- Executed:\n  - `mvn -q -Djapicmp.skip=true -Drat.skip=true -Dcheckstyle.skip=true -Dspotbugs.skip=true -Dpmd.skip=true -DskipITs clean verify`\n- Result:\n  - Compilation and non-network behavioral regression fixes were addressed (including `CleanerTest#preservesSourcePosition`).\n  - Full `verify` still fails in this sandbox due Netty socket restrictions (`Operation not permitted`) in `FormElementTest` environment setup.\n\n6. **Remaining risks**\n- Because this move required cross-package visibility adjustments for internals used by existing code/tests, there is API-surface expansion risk (more members exposed than before).\n- Full test pass cannot be confirmed in this sandbox because network/socket-based tests cannot run successfully here.\n"}}
